---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const description = 'Contact Dudley Development for app support, privacy questions, press, partnerships, product feedback, and studio inquiries.';
---
<Base title="Contact" description={description} path="/contact/">
<main class="contact-page" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<section class="contact-hero" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<a class="back" href="/" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>← Home</a>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Contact Dudley</p>
<h1 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Send the right note to the right place.</h1>
<p class="resource-lede" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
Dudley is a small iOS studio, so the fastest path is direct and specific.
        App issues go to support. Studio, press, partnerships, and product notes go to the general inbox.
</p>
</section>
<section class="contact-routes" aria-labelledby="contact-options" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<div class="section-heading" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Contact options</p>
<h2 id="contact-options" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Pick the closest reason.</h2>
</div>
<div class="route-grid" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<article class="route-card primary" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Support</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Something is broken or confusing in an app.</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Include app name, iPhone model, iOS version, the screen where it happened, and a screenshot or short recording.</p>
<a class="btn primary" href="mailto:support@dudleyapps.com?subject=Dudley%20app%20support" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Email support</a>
</article>
<article class="route-card" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Privacy</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Questions about app or website privacy.</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Use this for data, policy, tracking, deletion, or app-specific privacy questions. Please avoid sending sensitive photos unless needed.</p>
<a class="btn" href="mailto:support@dudleyapps.com?subject=Privacy%20question" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Ask privacy question</a>
</article>
<article class="route-card" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Studio</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Press, partnerships, and general inquiries.</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>For launch notes, collaboration ideas, Dudley-built apps, or studio questions that are not customer support.</p>
<a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@dudleyapps.com?subject=Dudley%20Development%20inquiry" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Contact studio</a>
</article>
<article class="route-card" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Feedback</span>
<h3 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Product ideas, bug context, or feature requests.</h3>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Tell us which app, what you expected, what happened, and why the change would improve the loop.</p>
<a class="btn" href="mailto:hello@dudleyapps.com?subject=App%20feedback" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Send feedback</a>
</article>
</div>
</section>
<section class="contact-routes" aria-labelledby="before-emailing" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<div class="section-heading" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Before emailing</p>
<h2 id="before-emailing" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>A few links may answer it faster.</h2>
</div>
<div class="link-list" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<a href="/support/" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Support hub</span>
<b data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>App-specific FAQs</b>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Reset steps, restore purchases, haptics, daily cards, Game Center, and privacy-adjacent app questions.</p>
</a>
<a href="/privacy/" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Privacy center</span>
<b data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Current policies</b>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Plain-language policies for VibeRater, Table Talk, Monetary Policy, and Dudley site surfaces.</p>
</a>
<a href="/answers/" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<span data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Answers</span>
<b data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Short explainers</b>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Concise pages for VibeRater Social and other app questions built for quick reading.</p>
</a>
</div>
</section>
<section class="contact-strip" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<div data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
<p class="resource-kicker" data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Response expectations</p>
<h2 data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>Human, direct, and usually concise.</h2>
<p data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl>
Dudley is small, so contact is direct rather than a ticket queue. Useful reports get handled fastest:
          app name, device context, exact step, and one clear screenshot or recording.
</p>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<style>.contact-page[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 36px));margin:0 auto;padding:58px 0 110px}.contact-hero[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{max-width:900px;padding:34px 0 54px}.resource-kicker[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin:0 0 14px;color:#a64913;font-size:13px;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.contact-hero[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h1[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.section-heading[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h2[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h2[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin:0;color:#2a1208;line-height:.96;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:900}.contact-hero[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h1[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{max-width:900px;font-size:clamp(46px,7vw,86px)}.resource-lede[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{max-width:760px;margin:24px 0 0;color:#775036;font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,22px);line-height:1.45}.contact-routes[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr;gap:44px;padding:60px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(68,30,9,.16)}.section-heading[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h2[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h2[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{font-size:clamp(34px,4.5vw,62px)}.route-grid[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] a[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{border:1px solid rgba(68,30,9,.14);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#fff8e7c7,#fff8e76b);box-shadow:0 18px 50px #3116070f}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:flex;min-height:292px;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:24px}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl].primary{border-color:#ff2fb340;background:radial-gradient(circle at 0 0,rgba(255,47,179,.13),transparent 18rem),linear-gradient(100deg,#fff8e7d1,#fff8e770)}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] span[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] span[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{color:#a64913;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] h3[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin:14px 0 10px;color:#2a1208;font-size:27px;line-height:1.04}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] p[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] p[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl],.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] p[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin:0;color:#775036;line-height:1.5}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] .btn[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin-top:auto}.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:grid;gap:12px}.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] a[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:block;padding:22px;color:#2a1208}.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] a[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]:hover{text-decoration:none;transform:translateY(-2px)}.link-list[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] b[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{display:block;margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:24px;line-height:1.05}.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{padding:30px}.contact-strip[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] p[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{max-width:760px;margin-top:18px;font-size:18px}@media(max-width:940px){.contact-routes[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px}}@media(max-width:720px){.route-grid[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{grid-template-columns:1fr}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{min-height:auto;gap:18px}.route-card[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl] .btn[data-astro-cid-uw5kdbxl]{margin-top:0}}
</style>
</Base>
